index 0000000..afd63a0
--- /dev/null
+++ b/dlls/dpnet/session.c
@@ -0,0 +1,1528 @@
+/*
+ * DirectPlay8 session state shared by the Peer, Client and Server objects
+ *
+ * There is no network engine behind these objects: an object that has been
+ * initialized keeps its state (message handler, application description,
+ * local player information, players, groups, outstanding asynchronous
+ * operations, capabilities) and answers the way DirectPlay8 does for that
+ * state.  Operations that would need a remote peer fail with the error a
+ * session without any reachable host produces.
+ *
